{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Iconic worlds collide in the world's most approachable, hilarious, public domain smashup!!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/66591a0667c0c775aee662255c58ba15.avif?t=1768265442\" width=1560 height=731 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/ab29969b049d9c0bfa82f5459ae0ca35.poster.avif?t=1768265442\" width=616 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/ab29969b049d9c0bfa82f5459ae0ca35.webm?t=1768265442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royalty Free-For-All brings an expressive cartoon twist and fun fighting game abilities to timeless heroes and villains like Dorothy Gale, Sweeney Todd, Lancelot, and more! Whether you fight on Old Macdonald's farm, The Center of the Earth, The Hundred-Acre Wood, every frame of every scene is hand-drawn and brought to life with a gorgeous art style inspired by animation cells and watercolor backgrounds some of the world's most famous settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Royalty Free-For-All</i> is designed with approachability for everyone in mind: First-time players of all ages and skill levels will love recognizing timeless characters in easy-to-follow cartoon brawls set to fresh remixes of legendary music, while veterans of the genre will find depth and complexity preserved in familiar mechanics like wavedashing, tech landing, foxtrots, and more! Hone your skills and take them online with our rollback netcode, or stay home and have a party fit for Gatsby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/9ef8bf8b80440019e450afa7362d7b36.poster.avif?t=1768265442\" width=616 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/9ef8bf8b80440019e450afa7362d7b36.webm?t=1768265442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royalty Free-For-All celebrates a wide range of ages and skillsets by making the genre more accessible than ever while maintaining its exciting pace and beloved mobility techniques. Light, Strong, and Special attacks make the zany flow of combat feel straightforward, even for first time players. So no more friends or family giving up after one match: Royalty Free-For-All is easy to learn and fun for everyone!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uh-oh: it's time to smash and some people don't know the controls! So we've boiled combat down to <strong><u>three simple buttons</u></strong>: Weak, Strong, and Special attack buttons work on the ground and in midair for a total of six offensive moves per fighter. Some stick to the six-move script, while others take the limits to their limits! Lilith, for example, can use charge states, angular influence, and fun juggling tricks to squeeze endless possibilities out of one simple projectile. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/0b148d1f443e7d7eb3ae0e47cf5c0078.poster.avif?t=1768265442\" width=616 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/extras/0b148d1f443e7d7eb3ae0e47cf5c0078.webm?t=1768265442\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can enjoy their exciting combos and hilarious interactions together in local multiplayer\u2014or, thanks to its rollback netcode, you can get good <strong><u>ONLINE\u00a0</u></strong>in both <u>1v1 QUICKPLAY</u>\u00a0and <u>PRIVATE LOBBIES</u> for up to four players (plus spectators!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Royalty Free-For-All\u2122 is in development for \u00a0PC and consoles. Interested players can stay up to date as development continues by wishlisting it on Steam and following on its socials on Twitter, Instagram, Facebook, YouTube, and TikTok, and even cast their vote for future content by visiting our website! All these links can be found in the game page to your right.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3176720?t=1768265442","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/17239064f43cbc13af690a54ad35bc84b891f1fc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768265442","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/6354f60fad5a28d9647734aeca3412afe76882d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768265442","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3176720/6354f60fad5a28d9647734aeca3412afe76882d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768265442","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support